; What the setup says and wears, beyond its pictures (design/installer/).
; Tauri includes this file ahead of the installer's pages, so these reach
; the welcome and finish pages. Colours are Paper's: --paper and --ink.

!define MUI_BGCOLOR "F4F0E7"
!define MUI_TEXTCOLOR "1C1B18"

!define MUI_WELCOMEPAGE_TITLE "Keep me awake"
!define MUI_WELCOMEPAGE_TEXT "A sun for your laptop. Click it and your laptop stays awake; click it again and it sleeps as usual.$\r$\n$\r$\nNothing is typed for you and nothing moves. It asks Windows to stay awake, the same way a video player does, and stops the moment you say.$\r$\n$\r$\nSetup puts it on this account only, needs no administrator rights, and takes a few seconds."

!define MUI_FINISHPAGE_TITLE "All set"
!define MUI_FINISHPAGE_TEXT "Keep me awake is installed. It lives in the tray, by the clock: click the sun there to open the window, right-click it for a menu of everything.$\r$\n$\r$\nClick the big sun, or press Space, and your laptop stays awake."

Caption "Keep me awake"
